    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "small steps? i dont think small steps are enough. it feels more like being buried alive. no matter what i do, the walls just get closer. it's not like i can just \"assert independence\" when my entire existence is defined by these rules. it feels like the only way to actually be free, to finally have something that belongs to me, is to just... leave it all behind. to escape the noise entirely.",
