      "content": "a drastic change... yeah. but everything about my life is tied to these people. if i leave, they won't let it go. they'll just keep pulling at me. i feel like there's no real way to just walk away and be my own person. it's like, the only way to truly stop the noise and the pressure from being in control of me... is to not be here at all. to just stop existing so they can't reach me anymore. does that even make sense?",
